/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0 g
42.5196850393700814 666.1419685039369369 Td
(2. Review Prepped Data: Ensure 'siteacronym' correctly prefixes with 'CA-' and matches the affinity or cohort column information.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0 g
42.5196850393700814 637.7955118110235162 Td
(3. Upload Append List: Download the appending list from the campaign matrix, never reuse an existing file from a prior run of this tool. This step will look for matches on 'siteacronym' or 'acronym', depending on the file.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 12 Tf
13.7999999999999989 TL
0 g
42.5196850393700814 609.4490551181102092 Td
(4. Finalize & Save: This is the last look at the file before download, quickly flag issues before downloading. The original affinity column is removed for Emma import. After downloading, run the prepped and appended new list through the Append Check Tool \(https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/02d5nxaxkifuav0806pa3/data_validation_tool_v2.html?rlkey=r96zhs0k6r3x6ih4wwvfjo8fi&dl=0\).) Tj
